#, fuzzy
msgid "Maven goal that is executed before the BuildMojo. The goal looks for a file that contains build time configuration options read during the previous build. If that file exists, the goal will check whether the configuration options used during the previous build have changed in the current configuration and will persist their current values to another file, so that both configuration files could be compared by tools caching build goal outcomes to check whether the previous outcome of the BuildMojo needs to be rebuilt."
msgstr "在 BuildMojo 之前执行的 Maven 目标。该目标会查找一个文件，其中包含上一次构建时读取的构建时配置选项。 如果该文件存在，该目标将检查上一次构建中使用的配置选项在当前配置中是否发生变化，并将它们的当前值保存到另一个文件中，以便通过缓存构建目标结果的工具对这两个配置文件进行比较，从而判断是否需要重新构建 BuildMojo 的上一次构建结果。"

